# Docker dev-harness artifact. docker/laravel-dev/docker-compose.yml bind-mounts
# its Vite override to this path, so Docker creates the file in the product tree
# on `up`. It must live under /var/www for Node to resolve `import 'vite'`, so it
# cannot simply be mounted somewhere harmless — ignore it instead.
# See docker/README.md ("Laravel assets: public/hot is the switch").
/vite.config.dev.js
